    <string name="accessibility_description">Lets Black Mask AI press buttons for you: turn Wi-Fi on or off, take a photo, take a screenshot, lock the phone. WhatsApp is never automated — you always tap Send yourself. It also guards the power menu with your PIN, and locks the apps you choose with a PIN or your fingerprint.</string>
